A small Rust service exposing big-number arithmetic (add, subtract, multiply) via rmcp. Includes BDD tests (src/calculator.feature).
Requirements
•
Rust (stable)
•
cargo
Quick start
•
Build: cargo build --release
•
Run (stdio RPC): cargo run -- stdio
•
Run (HTTP): cargo run -- http
Tests
•
cargo test
Notes
•
Uses rmcp, tokio, axum, serde.